Anastasia: ...so the village remembers itself again.
Anastasia: I was hoping you would come, traveler.
Anastasia: My name is Anastasia. Lirael is my daughter.
Anastasia: I sent her ahead, before the first echo broke.
Anastasia: She would not tell you that. She does not yet remember.
Anastasia: The seventeenth-hour alignment is closer than the elders admit.
Anastasia: When the second moon rises, the dissonance follows it down.
Anastasia: Stay near her. Stay near the bell.
Anastasia: That is all I can say tonight. Walk well.
